<rml>
<head>
    <title>RmlUi Sample Page</title>
    <link type="text/rcss" href="../rcss/style.rcss"/>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="header">
        <h1>🎮 Welcome to RmlUi!</h1>
        <p class="subtitle">Modern HTML/CSS Rendering on Nintendo Switch</p>
    </div>
    
    <div class="container">
        <div class="card">
            <h2>✨ Features</h2>
            <ul>
                <li>Full CSS3 Support</li>
                <li>Animations & Transforms</li>
                <li>Flexbox Layout</li>
                <li>Gamepad Navigation</li>
                <li>Touch Input</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
        
        <div class="card">
            <h2>🚀 Performance</h2>
            <p>RmlUi is optimized for real-time rendering in games and applications.</p>
            <p>Experience smooth 60 FPS UI rendering on Nintendo Switch!</p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="card highlight">
            <h2>🎨 Beautiful UI</h2>
            <p>Create stunning user interfaces with familiar HTML and CSS!</p>
            <button onclick="alert('Button clicked!')">Click Me!</button>
        </div>
        
        <div class="card">
            <h2>📚 Easy to Learn</h2>
            <p>If you know HTML and CSS, you already know RmlUi!</p>
            <p>RML is based on XHTML with CSS2/CSS3 styling.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
    
    <div class="footer">
        <p>Powered by RmlUi • Running on Switch2D Engine</p>
        <p>Press B to return to menu</p>
    </div>
</body>
</rml>
